          /*
          *********** Maze Creation ***********
          Imagine the Maze as a 2D grid, such that the rows are represented by z-axis, and the columns by the x-axis
          We compose the maze of two types of walls: horizontal walls (xwalls, denoted walls for short) and vertical walls (denoted zwalls)
          */
